{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology\/microservices' data-target='computer\/technology\/microservices' data-title='Microservices'>\r\n\t\t\tMicroservices\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Microservice architecture types: strangler, saga (orchestrated or choreographed), and aggregator.","label":"Architecture Types","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/microservices\/components","label":"Components","url":"\/computer\/technology\/microservices\/components"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Strangler<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEffectively two applications living in their own domain spaces. The new service slowly \"strangles\" the old one. The client has to be updated to use the new service.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Saga<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNeeded when there are many services with their own respective database, and transactions require a long time.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTwo ways:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Orchestrated<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCentralised. A central service keeps track and asks others to roll back in case of an error.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Choreographed<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEach service raises events and listens. In case of an error all roll back.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Aggregator<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA central service aggregates responses from multiple services. Send this aggregate response to the client.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/microservices\/architecture_types\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/microservices\/architecture_types\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/microservices\/components' data-target='computer\/technology\/microservices\/components' data-title='Components' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Components<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/technology\/microservices' data-target='computer\/technology\/microservices' data-title='Microservices'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Microservices<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}